{"metadata":{"description":"Per-conversation x-opencode-session injection for OpenCode Go in DeepSeek Harness - fixes 400 MissingSessionID without breaking other providers","id":"gh:1360230390","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-opencode-session-header","slug":"beihzb/dsh-opencode-session-header","topics":["coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","header-injection","llm","opencode","opencode-go","opencode-zen","prompt-caching","x-opencode-session"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Per-conversation x-opencode-session injection for OpenCode Go in DeepSeek Harness - fixes 400 Missin"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"gSessionID without breaking other providers"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-opencode-session-header"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Per-conversation `x-opencode-session` header injection for **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** → **OpenCode G"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"conversation `x-opencode-session` header injection for **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** → **OpenCode Go**."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"It fixes the `400 MissingSessionID` rejection **and** keeps OpenCode's per-conversation routing / pr"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ompt-cache optimization working — scoped strictly to `opencode.ai`, runtime-switchable without resta"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"rt, zero dependencies."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文文档"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Since 2026-09-05, OpenCode Go requires a stable `x-opencode-session` header on every inference reque"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"st (used for routing and prompt caching). DeepSeek Harness ≤ `0.1.2-rc.1` sends no such header on an"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"y adapter path, so **every opencode-go model call fails**:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Upstream fix is tracked in deepseek-harness discussion #5495 but has not shipped yet. This plugin fi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"lls the gap locally."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Why not the common workarounds?"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| | Static `headers` in settings.yaml | Global `opencode_zen` profile (dsh-custom-header) | **This p"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"c `headers` in settings.yaml | Global `opencode_zen` profile (dsh-custom-header) | **This plugin** |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Fixes the 400 | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Per-conversation id (cache / routing optimal) | ❌ one shared id → ca"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"che misses, slower & pricier | ✅ | ✅ real DSH session id |
| Other providers untouched | ✅ | ❌ rewri"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"tes UA + `x-opencode-*` on **every** host | ✅ `opencode.ai` only |
| Toggle without restart | — | — "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"| ✅ JSON file flip |
| Extra dependencies | — | third-party plugin, client bundle | none |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"or from a local clone / checkout:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then **restart dsh web** once — plugins load at boot. The startup log should show:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Runtime switch (no restart needed)"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"State file: `<DSH_HOME>/plugins/dsh-opencode-session-header.json` (defaults to `~/.dsh`):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- `false` → injection off (all requests pass through untouched);
- `true` or **file missing** → inje"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ction on;
- the file is re-read on every LLM request, so toggling takes effect immediately."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Two seams, both proven inside DSH `0.1.2-rc.1`:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. **`llm/stream` waterfall observer** — wraps every adapter stream iteration in an `AsyncLocalStora"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ge` carrying `GenerateOptions.sessionId` (stable per DSH conversation across turns, compaction and r"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"etries; fresh per conversation / fork / subagent).
2. **Fetch transport middleware** — stamps `x-ope"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ncode-session` **only** when the request host matches the allowlist (default: `opencode.ai` + subdom"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"ains). Value = the current session id, or the fallback id (`dsh-default`) outside any LLM context (e"},{"id":"p25s6","text":".g. model discovery). Every other host passes through byte-for-byte untouched."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The fetch pipeline runs under this plugin's own `Symbol.for` key (mechanics vendored from `@aizigao/"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"pi-fetch-pipeline`, MIT), so it coexists with other fetch-patching plugins instead of clobbering the"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"m. Header merging follows the fetch spec: whichever of `init.headers` / `Request.headers` would reac"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"h the wire is used as the merge base."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Testing"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Compatibility & retirement"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Built and verified against DSH `0.1.2-rc.1` (npm latest at release time).
- Depends on DSH outboun"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"d LLM traffic using the process-global `fetch`. If a future DSH build switches its network stack, th"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"e plugin silently stops injecting — the symptom is simply the 400 returning; uninstall then.
- Once "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"upstream ships native per-conversation session headers (discussion #5495), retire this plugin:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"then restart dsh web (optionally delete the switch file)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Credits"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- Fetch-pipeline mechanics vendored from `@aizigao/pi-fetch-pipeline` (MIT); the fetch-layer approac"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"h on DSH was proven by `dsh-custom-header` (MIT) by Asaiuta."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}
